cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "Analysis code: Incomplete by architecture - the relay architecture of probiotic metabolism"
abstract: "Analysis pipeline for a 351-genome, 41-unit probiotic pangenome: genome download and panel selection, two-level protein clustering, HMM-based relay trait annotation, direction assignment, Fitch ancestral-state reconstruction, dN/dS estimation, partner identification from 21 HMP2 metagenomes, and generation of all main and supplementary figures."
